B.a8T=new A.c5("4 \u2014 Read the Result","If the NG is within the band: no adjustment needed.\n\nIf outside:\n\u2022 NG too HIGH (closes too late) \u2192 CCW adjustment\n\u2022 NG too LOW (closes too early) \u2192 CW adjustment\n\n1 flat \u2248 1.3% NG change. Maximum 2 flats per adjustment.",null)
B.a8S=new A.c5("5 \u2014 Share PDF","Once a valid temperature is entered, a share button appears. Tap it to generate and share a PDF report with the chart and adjustment instructions.",null)
